# Noesis.io Health  - Client (Vite) Environment Configuration
# © 2026 Athena Core Technologies, Inc.
#
# These variables are bundled into the client build at build time. Only
# values prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to client code. NEVER put secrets
# (anything that grants server-side authority) in this file  - the server
# .env.example lives in server/.env.example.
#
# Copy to .env.local for local development; production values are injected
# by the build pipeline / hosting provider.

# ── ERROR MONITORING (Sentry) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Client-side DSN. Provision a project at https://sentry.io/ and paste the DSN
# here in deployment secrets (NEVER commit the real value). If unset, Sentry
# is a safe no-op.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
